---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import { siteConfig } from '../data/siteConfig';

const lastUpdated = 'September 2026';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Privacy Policy — Vindhya Umapathy"
  description="Privacy policy outlining data collection, usage, storage, and individual rights under applicable data protection legislation including the Digital Personal Data Protection Act (India)."
>
  <section class="section privacy-section" aria-label="Privacy Policy">
    <div class="container-reading">
      <!-- Header -->
      <div class="privacy-header">
        <h1 class="privacy-title">Privacy Policy</h1>
        <p class="privacy-meta">Last Updated: {lastUpdated} · Scope: vindhyaumapathy.com</p>
      </div>

      <!-- Legal Notice for Client / Launch Readiness -->
      <div class="compliance-callout">
        <span class="compliance-title">Pre-Launch Notice for Client:</span>
        <p class="compliance-text">
          This policy serves as the MVP operational privacy declaration under the India Digital Personal Data Protection (DPDP) Act and general international best practices. Prior to domain launch, verify the registered legal entity or sole proprietorship name and designated grievance officer contact.
        </p>
      </div>

      <!-- Policy Content -->
      <div class="policy-body">
        <section class="policy-block">
          <h2>1. Introduction</h2>
          <p>
            This Privacy Policy describes how <strong>Vindhya Umapathy</strong> ("we", "us", or "our"), operating the consulting practice and website at <strong>vindhyaumapathy.com</strong>, collects, processes, and protects personal data provided by visitors and prospective consulting clients.
          </p>
          <p>
            We are committed to maintaining the confidentiality and integrity of your personal information and handling it with transparency and care.
          </p>
        </section>

        <section class="policy-block">
          <h2>2. Information We Collect</h2>
          <p>
            We only collect personal information that you intentionally and voluntarily provide to us when submitting an inquiry via our contact form or directly via email:
          </p>
          <ul>
            <li><strong>Identification Data:</strong> Full name.</li>
            <li><strong>Contact Details:</strong> Business or personal email address.</li>
            <li><strong>Project Context:</strong> Topic of interest (e.g., workshop format, curriculum advisory, strategic inquiry) and any descriptive details included in your message.</li>
          </ul>
          <p>
            <strong>Analytics & Tracking Pixels:</strong> In our current MVP release, we do not utilize third-party behavioral tracking cookies, analytics pixels (e.g., Meta Pixel, Google Analytics), or programmatic advertising trackers.
          </p>
        </section>

        <section class="policy-block">
          <h2>3. Purpose and Legal Basis for Processing</h2>
          <p>
            We process your personal information strictly for the following purposes:
          </p>
          <ul>
            <li>To evaluate and respond to your consulting, speaking, or workshop inquiry.</li>
            <li>To schedule introductory discovery calls and draft collaborative proposals.</li>
            <li>To fulfill legitimate professional communications initiated by you.</li>
          </ul>
          <p>
            The legal basis for processing is your explicit consent provided at the time of form submission and our legitimate interest in responding to commercial and educational inquiries.
          </p>
        </section>

        <section class="policy-block">
          <h2>4. Data Storage, Retention & Security</h2>
          <p>
            Inquiries transmitted via our website contact form are routed securely over HTTPS (TLS encryption) directly to our designated business inbox. We retain your contact information only for as long as necessary to fulfill the communication or contractual relationship, or as required by applicable legal obligations.
          </p>
          <p>
            We implement administrative and technical safeguards to guard against unauthorized access, disclosure, alteration, or destruction of personal data.
          </p>
        </section>

        <section class="policy-block">
          <h2>5. Third-Party Service Providers</h2>
          <p>
            We do not sell, lease, or rent your personal information to third parties. We may use reputable infrastructure processors (such as form dispatch endpoints and email hosting providers) solely to deliver inquiry messages to our team under strict confidentiality terms.
          </p>
        </section>

        <section class="policy-block">
          <h2>6. Your Rights</h2>
          <p>
            Under applicable data protection legislation (including the Digital Personal Data Protection Act, 2023 in India, and the General Data Protection Regulation where applicable), you have the right to:
          </p>
          <ul>
            <li>Request a copy of the personal data we hold about you.</li>
            <li>Request correction or updating of inaccurate information.</li>
            <li>Request deletion or erasure of your personal contact records.</li>
            <li>Withdraw your consent to future communications at any time.</li>
          </ul>
        </section>

        <section class="policy-block">
          <h2>7. Contact & Grievance Redressal</h2>
          <p>
            If you have questions, feedback, or requests regarding this Privacy Policy or your personal information, please write directly to:
          </p>
          <div class="contact-box">
            <p><strong>Vindhya Umapathy</strong></p>
            <p>Design Strategist, Educator, Facilitator</p>
            <p>Bengaluru, Karnataka, India</p>
            <p>Email: <a href="mailto:hello@vindhyaumapathy.com">hello@vindhyaumapathy.com</a></p>
          </div>
        </section>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .privacy-section {
    padding-top: clamp(var(--space-8), 2rem + 3vw, var(--space-16));
    padding-bottom: clamp(var(--space-12), 3rem + 3vw, var(--space-20));
    background-color: var(--color-surface);
  }

  .privacy-header {
    margin-bottom: var(--space-8);
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: var(--space-2);
  }

  .privacy-title {
    font-family: var(--font-serif);
    font-size: clamp(var(--font-size-3xl), 2rem + 2vw, var(--font-size-4xl));
    color: var(--color-text-main);
  }

  .privacy-meta {
    font-size: var(--font-size-xs);
    color: var(--color-text-muted);
  }

  /* Compliance notice */
  .compliance-callout {
    padding: var(--space-4) var(--space-5);
    background-color: var(--color-surface-tint);
    border: 1px dashed var(--color-border);
    border-radius: var(--radius-md);
    margin-bottom: var(--space-8);
  }

  .compliance-title {
    display: block;
    font-size: var(--font-size-xs);
    font-weight: var(--font-weight-bold);
    color: var(--color-accent);
    margin-bottom: var(--space-1);
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: var(--letter-spacing-wide);
  }

  .compliance-text {
    font-size: var(--font-size-xs);
    color: var(--color-text-secondary);
    line-height: var(--line-height-normal);
  }

  /* Policy content */
  .policy-body {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: var(--space-8);
  }

  .policy-block {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: var(--space-3);
  }

  .policy-block h2 {
    font-family: var(--font-sans);
    font-size: var(--font-size-lg);
    font-weight: var(--font-weight-bold);
    color: var(--color-text-main);
  }

  .policy-block p {
    font-size: var(--font-size-base);
    color: var(--color-text-secondary);
    line-height: var(--line-height-relaxed);
  }

  .policy-block ul {
    padding-left: var(--space-6);
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: var(--space-2);
  }

  .policy-block li {
    font-size: var(--font-size-base);
    color: var(--color-text-secondary);
    line-height: var(--line-height-relaxed);
  }

  .contact-box {
    margin-top: var(--space-2);
    padding: var(--space-4);
    background-color: var(--color-bg-alt);
    border-radius: var(--radius-md);
    font-size: var(--font-size-sm);
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 2px;
  }

  .contact-box a {
    color: var(--color-accent);
    text-decoration: underline;
  }
</style>
